\ Compiled string, runtime calls and a while/repeat loop.
:tx $ffff c! ;
:count dup 1+ swap c@ ;
:type dup [ while ] 1- >r dup c@ tx 1+ r> dup [ repeat ] 2drop ;
:message "Hello, World!" ;
:main message count type 13 tx 10 tx ;

\ Build the reset entry: PUSH16 main, CALL, BREAK (simulation stop marker).
[ 'main boot! ]
